WEBVTT

00:00:07.426 --> 00:00:09.246
[sighs] You're supposed
to be my friend.

00:00:10.206 --> 00:00:11.526
Stop trying to be my dad.

00:00:12.738 --> 00:00:14.158
[sighs]

00:00:16.375 --> 00:00:18.275
I can take care of myself.

00:00:18.875 --> 00:00:20.295
Sonic,
taking care of yourself

00:00:20.816 --> 00:00:22.495
is not what being
a hero's all about.

00:00:23.235 --> 00:00:25.336
It's about
taking responsibility
for other people.

00:00:26.655 --> 00:00:28.515
And right now,
whether you want
to hear this or not,

00:00:28.576 --> 00:00:29.916
you are still just a kid.

00:00:30.456 --> 00:00:32.096
You got some more
growing up to do

00:00:32.096 --> 00:00:33.675
before you're ready
to be the big hero.

00:00:34.936 --> 00:00:36.655
But trust me
when I tell you,

00:00:36.655 --> 00:00:38.875
there will come a time
when your powers
will be needed.

00:00:41.175 --> 00:00:42.795
But you don't choose
that moment.

00:00:43.916 --> 00:00:45.196
That moment chooses you.

00:00:46.116 --> 00:00:48.316
Whoa. Look at you.
[chuckles]

00:00:48.656 --> 00:00:50.815
Look at that.
I just got goose bumps.

00:00:51.536 --> 00:00:53.216
Wait a second.
Did you steal that from Oprah?

00:00:53.436 --> 00:00:55.756
No, sir. That is
a Wachowski family special.

00:00:56.555 --> 00:00:57.596
Came from my dad,

00:00:58.196 --> 00:01:00.356
in this very boat,
on this very lake.

00:01:01.795 --> 00:01:03.795
He would always try and steer me
in the right direction.

00:01:05.015 --> 00:01:07.076
And that's what Maddie and I
have always tried to do
with you.

00:01:09.295 --> 00:01:11.336
So, until
your moment arrives,

00:01:11.336 --> 00:01:14.515
I want you to work on
being a little more responsible.

00:01:16.495 --> 00:01:17.495
Comprende?

00:01:18.515 --> 00:01:19.515
Comprende.

00:01:20.615 --> 00:01:21.615
High five on it.

00:01:22.576 --> 00:01:26.135
Yeah! Donut Lord
and the Blue Blur
are back at it again!

00:01:26.239 --> 00:01:27.838
Hang on.

00:01:27.943 --> 00:01:29.021
Speedboat!

00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:31.038
Whoa! Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!

00:01:32.393 --> 00:01:33.993
[Sonic laughing]
[Tom] Sonic!

00:01:34.096 --> 00:01:36.322
[Sonic] Whoo-hoo!

00:01:36.426 --> 00:01:40.306
How excited are you,
going to Hawaii with me?
Oh, Hawaii.

00:01:40.746 --> 00:01:41.746
Oh, yeah!
[chuckles]

00:01:43.105 --> 00:01:44.105
Wow.[laughs]

00:01:44.826 --> 00:01:48.066
Welcome to Sonic Air,
the fastest way to travel.

00:01:48.326 --> 00:01:49.906
Now boarding groups
one and two.

00:01:51.486 --> 00:01:52.206
[laughs] Oh!

00:01:52.206 --> 00:01:54.766
Sonic, this is so fun!

00:01:54.886 --> 00:01:57.666
I'm sorry, ma'am,
you're group three.
Please wait your turn.

00:01:57.806 --> 00:01:59.286
Anyone from groups
one and two?

00:01:59.306 --> 00:02:00.605
Just let him
get it out of his system.
Nobody?

00:02:00.726 --> 00:02:02.886
Okay, then everybody else
right this way.

00:02:03.485 --> 00:02:04.485
Thank you.

00:02:04.573 --> 00:02:07.942
[imitating
electronic scanner noises]

00:02:08.031 --> 00:02:09.031
[laughs]

00:02:09.066 --> 00:02:10.226
And you, sir?
[imitating scanner]

00:02:12.386 --> 00:02:13.646
Terrible shirt detected.

00:02:14.046 --> 00:02:15.046
There we go.

00:02:15.406 --> 00:02:17.646
Okay, you're free to go.
Enjoy your trip.

00:02:17.866 --> 00:02:18.866
Bye-bye now.

00:02:19.346 --> 00:02:20.346
[sighs]
Okay.

00:02:21.346 --> 00:02:22.346
Bring it in.

00:02:22.566 --> 00:02:25.446
Tom, I'm about to be
hedgehog of the house
for the first time.

00:02:25.706 --> 00:02:28.046
I think I'm a little mature
to hug you goodbye.

00:02:28.466 --> 00:02:31.126
Okay, what about
a power bump?
Power bump?

00:02:31.126 --> 00:02:32.306
Yes, power bump.

00:02:32.306 --> 00:02:33.746
That's more like it.

00:02:34.346 --> 00:02:35.346
[all] Wachowski!

00:02:35.786 --> 00:02:37.786
Okay, use this one
to get back home.

00:02:38.026 --> 00:02:39.026
Oh!

00:02:39.906 --> 00:02:42.485
All right, we're off.
Be good.

00:02:42.626 --> 00:02:44.446
Yes.
You have our number.

00:02:44.546 --> 00:02:47.326
Sorry! Can't hear you!
You're traveling through
a cross-dimensional portal!

00:02:47.485 --> 00:02:48.546
Miss you already!
Okay?

00:02:48.926 --> 00:02:50.146
Have fun
at Rachel's wedding!

00:02:52.336 --> 00:02:54.536
Okay, it's 48 hours
until they come back.

00:02:54.636 --> 00:02:56.356
We've got TV channels,
streaming channels,

00:02:56.476 --> 00:02:58.375
a house full of food
and no supervision.

00:02:58.455 --> 00:02:59.455
[barks]

00:02:59.735 --> 00:03:00.735
Let's do this.

00:03:01.843 --> 00:03:04.578
["Here Comes The Hotstepper"
playing]

00:03:04.682 --> 00:03:06.758
♪ Na-na-na-na♪

00:03:06.863 --> 00:03:08.316
♪ Na-na-na-na♪

00:03:08.421 --> 00:03:10.463
♪ Here comes the hotstepper
Murderer♪

00:03:10.567 --> 00:03:12.956
♪ I'm the lyrical gangster
Murderer♪

00:03:13.059 --> 00:03:15.794
♪ Pick up the crew in-a de area
Murderer♪

00:03:15.898 --> 00:03:18.944
♪ Still love you like that
Murderer♪

00:03:19.049 --> 00:03:23.825
♪ Extraordinary
Juice like a strawberry♪

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:28.049
♪ Money to burn, baby
All of the time♪

00:03:28.153 --> 00:03:30.957
♪ Cut to fit is me♪

00:03:31.061 --> 00:03:33.484
♪ Fit to cut is she♪

00:03:33.589 --> 00:03:37.050
♪ Come juggle with me
I say every time♪

00:03:37.154 --> 00:03:39.405
♪ Here comes the hotstepper
Murderer♪

00:03:39.508 --> 00:03:41.724
♪ I'm the lyrical gangster
Murderer♪

00:03:41.828 --> 00:03:44.043
♪ Dial emergency number
Murderer♪

00:03:44.147 --> 00:03:47.575
♪ Still love you like that
Murderer ♪

00:03:47.678 --> 00:03:49.201
♪ Nah, na-na-na-nah♪

00:03:49.306 --> 00:03:51.244
♪ Na-na-na-na, na-na-na
Na-na-na♪

00:03:51.348 --> 00:03:53.286
♪ Na-na-na-nah♪

00:03:53.391 --> 00:03:55.779
[siren noise playing]

00:03:55.884 --> 00:03:57.268
♪ It's how we do it, man♪

00:03:57.371 --> 00:03:58.895
Whoo-hoo!

00:03:58.999 --> 00:04:01.457
♪ Na-na-na-na
Na-na-na, na-na-na♪

00:04:01.561 --> 00:04:03.223
♪ Na-na-na-nah♪

00:04:03.326 --> 00:04:04.884
♪ Yeah, man♪

00:04:05.611 --> 00:04:06.995
♪ It's how we do it♪

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:11.011
♪ Na-na-na-na
Na-na-na, na-na-na♪

00:04:11.116 --> 00:04:13.401
♪ Na-na-na-nah♪

00:04:25.274 --> 00:04:28.771
[device beeping]

00:04:28.876 --> 00:04:31.316
If these readings
are accurate, he's here.

00:04:31.816 --> 00:04:32.816
I found him!

00:04:33.136 --> 00:04:34.556
I just hope
I'm not too late.

00:04:36.144 --> 00:04:37.591
[grunts]

00:04:51.711 --> 00:04:52.769
[device beeps]

00:04:52.876 --> 00:04:54.416
Hmm.
He's close.

00:04:54.596 --> 00:04:56.976
I just need a way
to reach him
without being spotted.

00:04:59.256 --> 00:05:01.596
Standard human transport.
Perfect.

00:05:01.703 --> 00:05:03.845
♪ This is how we do it♪

00:05:03.951 --> 00:05:06.807
[phone buzzing]

00:05:09.127 --> 00:05:11.019
♪ This is how we do it♪

00:05:11.126 --> 00:05:12.726
♪ It's Friday night♪

00:05:12.841 --> 00:05:14.416
Uh-oh.

00:05:14.530 --> 00:05:16.220
Oh, boy.

00:05:19.368 --> 00:05:20.520
[clears throat]

00:05:20.636 --> 00:05:21.636
Aloha![laughs]

00:05:22.376 --> 00:05:24.316
How's it going, bud?
[Sonic] Oh, you know.

00:05:24.436 --> 00:05:27.256
Just a quiet night at home,
settling in with a good book.

00:05:27.416 --> 00:05:28.676
And you?
What's up with you?

00:05:28.956 --> 00:05:30.336
I was just calling
to say we're here.

00:05:30.535 --> 00:05:32.936
But now every word out
of your mouth
is making me suspicious.

00:05:33.436 --> 00:05:37.696
What?
You got to relax, buddy.
You're at the Four Seasons Oahu.

00:05:38.295 --> 00:05:40.696
Have a mai tai.
Enjoy some time with your wife.

00:05:40.876 --> 00:05:42.636
Get sunburned
somewhere embarrassing.

00:05:43.035 --> 00:05:44.795
This weekend is about you.

00:05:45.196 --> 00:05:47.856
You know what? You're right.
We power-bumped on it.

00:05:47.856 --> 00:05:49.296
So whatever it is
you're doing,

00:05:49.436 --> 00:05:51.576
I'm sure you can undo it
by the time we get home, yeah?

00:05:51.896 --> 00:05:56.256
Exactly! I mean,
I am deeply offended
by such accusations!

00:05:56.916 --> 00:05:58.316
So, how's Rachel's fiancé?

00:05:58.556 --> 00:06:00.795
Is he as good-looking
in person as he is
in pictures?

00:06:00.906 --> 00:06:02.964
Hey, baby.

00:06:03.076 --> 00:06:04.556
[sighs]
Somehow better-looking.

00:06:04.956 --> 00:06:08.096
[Sonic] Wow! You're about to be
the third best-looking dude
in the family.

00:06:08.336 --> 00:06:09.576
But, hey,
still on the podium.

00:06:09.856 --> 00:06:10.856
Ha-ha-ha.

00:06:11.136 --> 00:06:13.275
All right,
I better go
and introduce myself.

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:15.792
Stay out of trouble.

00:06:15.976 --> 00:06:17.295
Trouble?
Don't worry.

00:06:17.295 --> 00:06:19.416
Everything here
is completely normal.

00:06:19.896 --> 00:06:21.896
Uh-huh. Night, bud.

00:06:22.936 --> 00:06:24.775
Hey! I was just
coming over to say hi.

00:06:24.775 --> 00:06:26.275
You've got a lot
of nerve coming up in here

00:06:26.275 --> 00:06:27.555
after what you did
to my fiancée.

